  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Disability Equity and Rights Technical Assistance (Global) - 2018-25</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Investment enables the provision of technical assistance and other enabling services to support disability equity and rights in the Australian development program. This investment includes the costs associated with approaching the market; preparing the scope of services; and obtaining external independent evaluation of tenders. This investment also includes the provision of technical assistance and support, provided to DFAT through a partnership agreement, and an independent review of the partnership. This investment is an enabler to implement the International Development Policy and Australia&apos;s International Disability Equity and Rights Strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
